  "description": "* (Disclaimer: The content in this video is intended for educational and informational purposes only)\nMoncks Corner, South Carolina — On June 14, 2025, just after 2:30 a.m., Deputies with the Berkeley County Sheriff's Office were conducting a traffic stop near the intersection of South Live Oak Drive and Wildwood Lane when they detained a driver suspected of DUI. While the deputies were standing just steps away from their patrol vehicle, a second impaired driver collided with the vehicle. The South Carolina Highway Patrol responded to investigate the crash and has since charged 32-year-old Lauren Michelle Skinner with Transporting Alcohol in a Motor Vehicle with a Broken Seal, Driving Under Suspension – Second Offense and Driving Under the Influence – Second Offense. Skinner received a total bond of $4,527.50.\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nSpecial thanks to Shout-Out Supporters on Patreon:\n- 'DIY Solar Power with Will Prowse'\n- Bagpiper Joshua Agee\n- '1000ak'\n- 'Excellent I. McGill IV'\n- Arnelle Dunlap\n- FloridaOperative\n- thomas\n- 'PrussianBlue'\n- Cody Stephens\n- Kaedyn\n- Daniel G\n- David, Guershom\n- 'K9 Kampers with Alfredo'\n- Troy Polansky\n- Tulla Belle\n- 'quadrakyiro'\n- Scott Mackin\n- \"John B. GunsSaveLife\"\n- david wallace\n- '10izshoe'\n- 'Wilcer - Crank Hustle'\n- 'DerLitti86'\n- Brice Danos\n- 'PhlyDaily'\n- Brandon M.\n- Jesse\n- Jeff Short\n- RayJayOB\n- Sean Sheldon\n- Josef Rex\n- 'Jun'\n- 'Xenik'\n- 'GotsNoGroove Cheryl'\n- James Pringle\n- Kelly Goodwin\n- 'Dawesenm'\n- 'Brother.Legal'\n- Paul Rohrbaugh\n- 'Krazy KZ'\n- Zach Williams\n- Michael R Sheffield\n- Rich Biggs\n- 'AccuShoot.com'\n- Lisa Overly\n- 'Necko'\n- Gerardo Flores\n- 'coco Coco'\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nSupport us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/PoliceActivity\nFollow us on X: https://x.com/Police_Activity\n\n- Links to the Best Dash Cams you can buy.\nViofo A229 Pro 4K HDR: https://amzn.to/4dYwN2b\nGarmin Mini 3 1080p: https://amzn.to/41hmktx\nVantrue N5 2.7K: https://amzn.to